### Local
POST http://localhost:7071/api/translate
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "text": "こんにちは。"
}

### Azure
POST {{$dotenv AZURE_FUNCTION_URL}}/api/translate
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
x-functions-key: {{$dotenv AZURE_FUNCTION_KEY}}

{
  "text": "こんにちは。"
}
